---
/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   How long treatment takes.

   Renamed 2026-09-09 from /admissions/length-of-stay/. "Length of stay" is
   industry jargon; nobody searches it. The page answers "how long is rehab",
   which people do search, and the framing moved off our authorization process
   and onto the person planning time away.

   Length of stay is raised on 78 of 571 Buena Vista calls (14%) — the largest
   remaining admissions topic once loose patterns are discarded. ("Phone" looked
   bigger at first pass, but most of those matches were "on the phone" and
   "phone assessment" rather than the phone policy.)

   RANGES come from the client wiki:
     Detox        5–7 days commercial · 3 days Medicaid
     Residential  25–30 days commercial · 30–45 days Medicaid
   Outpatient (45–90 days, sometimes more) and the 90–120 day end-to-end figure
   came from the client on 2026-09-21, with the rest of the continuum.
   Admissions corroborates the detox figure, describing alcohol as usually
   needing "the full seven days".

   Note the inversion worth keeping in the copy: Medicaid residential
   authorizations tend to run LONGER than commercial ones. Most people assume
   the reverse, so it is stated plainly here and on the AHCCCS page.

   Ranges are presented as ranges, never as promises, and the page leans on the
   program being voluntary — nobody is held anywhere.

   STYLE: no call-data sourcing in the copy, no exclusionary framing.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopBar from '../../components/TopBar.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';

import LengthHero from '../../components/lengthofstay/LengthHero.astro';
import WhatDecidesIt from '../../components/lengthofstay/WhatDecidesIt.astro';
import LengthQuestions from '../../components/lengthofstay/LengthQuestions.astro';

import Testimonials from '../../components/Testimonials.astro';
import VerifySection from '../../components/VerifySection.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';

const title = 'How Long Is Rehab? Detox, Residential and Outpatient Timelines | Buena Vista';
const description =
  'Detox usually takes four to seven days, residential around thirty, and outpatient treatment 45 to 90 days — roughly 90 to 120 days of care end to end in Chandler, AZ.';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    ['How long is medical detox?',
     'Usually four to seven days. Alcohol commonly needs the longer end of that range, often close to a full week, and the exact length depends on your history and how your body responds.'],
    ['How long is residential treatment?',
     'Around thirty days is typical. Some stays run longer where the clinical picture calls for it and the plan supports it, and Medicaid authorizations often extend toward forty-five days.'],
    ['Can I do detox and residential treatment back to back?',
     'Yes. Both happen in the same building with the same team, so it is one continuous stay rather than a discharge and a separate second admission.'],
    ['How long is the full continuum of care?',
     'Around 90 to 120 days end to end. Detox usually runs four to seven days and residential around thirty, then PHP and IOP step the hours down, and outpatient treatment typically runs 45 to 90 days and sometimes more.'],
    ['How long is outpatient treatment?',
     'Typically 45 to 90 days, sometimes more if that is what is needed. Schedules grow with you so that work, school and family responsibilities can gradually reenter your life while treatment continues around them.'],
    ['What if I need to leave treatment early?',
     'Treatment is voluntary throughout. Raising it early with your case manager usually surfaces something solvable, and if not they will help plan a safe exit rather than an unsupported one.'],
  ].map(([q, a]) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a },
  })),
};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <TopBar />
  <Nav />

  <LengthHero />
  <WhatDecidesIt />
  <Testimonials />
  <VerifySection />
  <LengthQuestions />

  <FinalCTA />

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} is:inline />
</Layout>
